🛒 **Retail Sales Analysis Dashboard** — An interactive Power BI project designed to provide a comprehensive view of retail business performance. The dashboard analyzes **total revenue, year-over-year sales growth, customer activity, transaction trends, category performance, payment methods, online vs. in-store sales, and weekday purchasing patterns**. It incorporates **DAX measures, time intelligence, data modeling, and interactive filters** to transform transactional data into meaningful insights and support data-driven business decisions. 📊💰👥📈
